! 0 200 200 480 1
PAGE-WIDTH 576
; --- QR: automatic and manual payloads ---
B QR 20 20 U 6
MA,QR code ABC123
ENDQR
B QR 250 20 U 4
H0M,N0123456789012345
ENDQR
; --- PDF-417 with XD/YD/C/S options ---
B PDF-417 20 150 XD 3 YD 12 C 3 S 2
PDF Data
ABCDE12345
ENDPDF
; --- Aztec ---
B AZTEC 300 150 XD 4 EC 47
123456789012
ENDAZTEC
; --- EG hex graphics (2 bytes x 8 rows) ---
EG 2 8 460 20 F0F0F0F0F0F0F0F00F0F0F0F0F0F0F0F
; --- scalable text at point sizes, rotated ---
SCALE-TEXT PLL_LAT.CSF 12 12 20 300 12 PT FONT
ROTATE 90
SCALE-TEXT PLL_LAT.CSF 10 10 550 300 ROTATED
ROTATE 0
; --- multiline block ---
ML 30
TEXT 5 0 20 360
line one
line two
ENDML
; --- inverse line over text ---
T 4 2 20 430 $123.45
IL 15 440 200 440 20
; --- vertical text ---
VTEXT 4 0 540 20 VERT
; --- aborted session contributes nothing ---
! 0 200 200 100 1
TEXT 4 0 10 10 DROPPED
ABORT
FORM
PRINT
